CATEGORIES:Part of the line closed
DESCRIPTION:🚧 Part of the line closed\n\nWillesden Junction to Richmond
 \nDates as listed by TfL: Sunday 6 December 2026\n\nTfL live status (Reduc
 ed Service\, checked 28 November 2026): MILDMAY LINE: Sunday 6 December\, 
 a reduced service will operate between Camden Road and Willesden Junction 
 (via West Hampstead). Some trains will be diverted after Camden Road to/fr
 om Willesden Junction (Low Level) via South Hampstead\, Kilburn High Road
 \, Queens Park and Kensal Green.\nTfL live status (Part Closure\, checked 
 28 November 2026): MILDMAY LINE: Sunday 6 December\, no service between Wi
 llesden Junction and Richmond. There will also be no DISTRICT LINE service
  between Turnham Green and Richmond. Replacement bus service DL3 operates 
 between Willesden Junction and Richmond via Acton Central (The Vale)\, Sou
 th Acton (Acton Lane)\, Turnham Green Station\, Chiswick Park (Chiswick Hi
 gh Road)\, Gunnersbury and Kew Gardens (Royal Botanic Gardens).\n\nSource:
  TfL planned track closures\, correct at Monday 16 November 2026. https://
 tfl.gov.uk/api/document/plannedtrackclosures.pdf?id=accc98cf-e761-47b3-a43
 b-3de08a097b8f&type=document\nPlans can change. Check before you travel: h
 ttps://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/\nPowered by TfL Open Data\nU
 nofficial calendar\, not produced or endorsed by Transport for London.
