CATEGORIES:Closure in the late evening or overnight only
DESCRIPTION:🌙 Closure in the late evening or overnight only\n\nWillesde
 n Junction to Stratford\, eastbound only\, after 23:00\nDates as listed by
  TfL: Wednesday 9 December to Thursday 10 December 2026\n\nTfL live status
  (Part Closure\, checked 28 November 2026): MILDMAY LINE: Tuesday 8\, Wedn
 esday 9 and Thursday 10 December\, after 2345 each evening\, no westbound 
 service from Stratford to Camden Road. The 2359 and 0015 services from Str
 atford will start from Camden Road at 0018 and 0035. Customers should use 
 the last westbound service from Stratford at 2344\, or local bus routes 30
 \, 274\, 388\, 393 or 488.\nTfL live status (Reduced Service\, checked 28 
 November 2026): MILDMAY LINE: Wednesday 9 and Thursday 10 December\, the 2
 129 and 2159 trains from Stratford to Richmond\, and 2135 train from Strat
 ford to Clapham Junction\, terminate at Camden Road\, the 2147 Clapham Jun
 ction to Stratford train will not run\, the 2148 train from Richmond to St
 ratford and the 2203 and 2234 trains from Clapham Junction to Stratford wi
 ll terminate at Willesden Junction.\nTfL live status (Part Closure\, check
 ed 28 November 2026): MILDMAY LINE: Wednesday 9 and Thursday 10 December\,
  after 2300\, no eastbound service from Willesden Junction to Stratford. C
 ustomers should use the last eastbound services detailed below or London O
 verground services to Euston. Last through trains: Clapham Junction to Str
 atford 2218\; Richmond to Stratford 2232\; Willesden Junction to Stratford
  2252. The 2249 train from Richmond to Stratford will not run. The 2302 tr
 ain from Richmond to Stratford will terminate at Willesden Junction. The 2
 318 train from Richmond to Willesden Junction will not run\n\nSource: TfL 
 planned track closures\, correct at Monday 16 November 2026. https://tfl.g
 ov.uk/api/document/plannedtrackclosures.pdf?id=accc98cf-e761-47b3-a43b-3de
 08a097b8f&type=document\nPlans can change. Check before you travel: https:
 //tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/\nPowered by TfL Open Data\nUnoffi
 cial calendar\, not produced or endorsed by Transport for London.
